Feature: Create new project
    Description: 

Scenario: Create project
    Given there is an employee
    When employee with created name: "New project"
    Then there is a project called "New project"

Scenario: Create project with the same name
    Given there is an employee
    And there is a project called "New project"
    When employee tries to create project called "New project"
    Then the error code is: "Already a project with given name"